NOTE ON SCOPE

This file licenses the *text* of the project: the pages under docs/ and this
repository's prose. The *code* in this repository (build configuration and
workflow) is licensed separately under Apache-2.0 — see LICENSE-CODE.

The project also asks adapters to preserve its foundational ansatz. That ask is
recorded in ANSATZ_PRESERVATION.md. It is deliberately kept OUT of this file:
CC BY 4.0 forbids imposing additional restrictions, so a "CC BY plus condition"
would no longer be CC BY. The ansatz text is a request and a community norm, not
a term of this license, and nothing in it restricts the rights granted above.
